703.03, "timestamp": "01:51:43", "text": "私たちが直面する唯一の問題は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6705.189, "timestamp": "01:51:45", "text": "料理の辛さが足りない。そして"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6707.109, "timestamp": "01:51:47", "text": "たとえ一番辛いものを頼んだとしても、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6710.47, "timestamp": "01:51:50", "text": "一番辛い？辛くないよ。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6713.51, "timestamp": "01:51:53", "text": "私たちはファムボーイマサラに行きたい。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6715.27, "timestamp": "01:51:55", "text": "私は透明なお酒が本当に好きなんです。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6717.189, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "text": "ブレンドやウイスキーのような熟成期間を好む。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 6717.304, "timestamp": "01:51:57", "author": "@notpravinlol", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/t9UXLD6AmzS1-YItB_6_Kz4uAutM3H0oNxaU47_WUxq4oWNpbcDQvZiftO3UE0nS_-jgazDe=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "where is that place which has soo many red gates and there's something written on them, some temple i suppose?"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 6719.189, "timestamp": "01:51:59", "text": "ウイスキーは美味しい。二日酔いにならない。"}]